// The project `shop-dev` as a Satz team writes it: the template's inputs bound here, the
// template used. This file is the whole instance — the template carries the resources, the
// providers and the organisation's interface — and it compiles to the HCL the template
// compiles to, with these values in `terraform.tfvars`.

estate shop_dev

params {
  application = "shop"
  stage       = "dev"
  cost_centre = "4711"
}

use "simple-project.satz"
